# Backups are machine-local snapshots, not source. The whole directory is
# excluded rather than just *.json, so a stray .bak, .zip, or export dropped in
# here cannot slip into a commit. The app recreates the directory on demand
# (ensureDirs in server/store.js), so nothing needs to be tracked to keep it.
data/backups/
